      "description": "**Location:** On the far west side, at the bottom of The Ancient Rift  \n**Solution:** Obtain all 3 Engraved Stones and insert them into the 3 holes to unlock the Cresset\n- [Engraved Stone](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=552084#L)\n- [Engraved Stone](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=552085#L)\n- [Engraved Stone](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=552086#L)   \n\n**Related Challenge:** Winding Paths Mazes  \n**Reward:** \n- Abyss Artifact\n- [Rivenheim Cloth Armor](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=940387)",
