      "mapLng": -0.74617445468854,
      "description": "**Location:** Inside the underground caverns of the [Secret Chamber of the Golden Plains](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=550076)  \n**Solution:**  Find the symbols from the grid of symbols in each of the locations as indicated by the map on the wall.  Push in 5 of the symbol stones to reveal the Cresset:\n- Grape\n- Horse\n- Bird\n- Pomegranate \n- Fish\n\n**Related Challenge:** Secret Chamber of the Golden Plains Ruins   \n**Reward:** \n- Abyss Artifact \n- [Memories of Prosperity](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=557211)",
