      "groupId": "mg-group:2680",
      "world": "Pywel",
      "region": "Hernand",
      "mapLat": 0.71223689550278,
      "mapLng": -0.91400027275034,
      "description": "**Location:** The ancient ruins just within the tree line in Deepfrog Basin.  \n**Solution:** Stab your sword into the rotating wheel and align the 5 pillars to the same height as the far left pillar to unlock. Pillars will glow when at correct height.  \n\n**Related Challenge:** Deepfrog Basin Everfrost Ruins  \n**Reward:** \n- Abyss Artifact",
