      "description": "**Challenge:** Restoration - The Abyss  \n\n**Hints to Progress:** \n- All 4 logic chips need to be set into their sockets\n- 2 are underground - use the electric block to flip the floor \n- Use a jumping downward Force Palm to set the chips\n- Use Axiom Force to pull out and manipulate the chips",
      "color": "#393939",
