      "mapLat": 0.65965864006488,
      "mapLng": -0.80064676702247,
      "description": "**Location:** Inside the [Silent Falls Hideout](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=546306) - after entering the [boss](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=545761) arena, climb up the opposite wall on the right side as indicated by the [treasure map](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=546387).  Your lantern will reveal a leaf symbol on the door    \n**How to Access:** \n- Climb to the door, hold Resist, then Force Palm the door \n- You can avoid the [boss](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=545761) by climbing up to the ledge on the right after entering, then sneaking to the trapdoor\n\n**Behind the Passage:**\n- [Treasure Chest](https://mapgenie.io/crimson-desert/maps/pywel?locationIds=550177)",
